    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Monthly KPI Report Automation\nToday: Sarah does the same routine on the first working day of each month around 09:00: \u201cMonthly KPI report\u201d, \u201cexport job report (jobs)\u201d, \u201cupdate kpi spreadsheet (spreadsheet)\u201d. That is once a month.\nEstimated time saved: 1.76 hours a month (an estimate; see the report).\nRisk: low - Mistakes in internal KPI reporting are easily corrected and do not directly impact customers or finances.\n\nBefore switching on: set the trigger's credentials, EMAIL_API_URL, APPROVAL_WEBHOOK_URL and AI_API_KEY in the n8n environment.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 620,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "627d9444-72f6-517b-9a74-5d9d0a82f982",
      "name": "About this workflow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        200
      ]
    }
